# Three Settings panes overlapping, after MarkEdit's Settings shot: Edit at
# the back left, Themes above and right of it, General in front. The point is
# a neat stack, not every control; tighter overlap lets the group scale up.
# expect: General, Themes, Edit
# Settings labels are 13 pt and cannot zoom.
# legible: 24
# combine: 8c-settings-edit 8b-settings-themes 8a-settings-general
# layout: 0.36,0.49 0.63,0.33 0.6,0.67
